## Why This Is Asked
This angle tests the ability to quantify a data-heavy feature with a clear offline-first constraint, balancing device resources against business value.

## Key Concepts
- Offline-first architectures
- Local indexing and delta synchronization
- Resource budgeting (CPU, memory, storage)
- Data transfer costs and break-even analysis

## Code Example
```
// Implementation sketch: simple local search index
class LocalIndex {
  constructor() { this.docs = []; }
  build(docs) { this.docs = docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, text: d.content })); }
  search(q) {
    const terms = q.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/);
    return this.docs.filter(d => terms.every(t => d.text.toLowerCase().includes(t)));
  }
  deltaUpdate(changes) {
    // apply lightweight patches to docs
    changes.forEach(c => {
      const idx = this.docs.findIndex(d => d.id === c.id);
      if (idx >= 0) this.docs[idx] = { ...this.docs[idx], ...c.patch };
      else this.docs.push({ id: c.id, text: c.patch.content });
    });
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you implement delta-sync to minimize data transfer while ensuring consistency?
- What privacy controls would you layer to protect sensitive docs during offline usage?

## Why This Is Asked

Assess understanding of privacy-preserving, on-device analytics and the viability of data-sharing via aggregates.

## Key Concepts

- On-device analytics and data minimization
- User consent and opt-in UX
- Aggregated data leakage risk and privacy controls
- Cost modeling: device runtime, memory, and backend bandwidth
- Rollout strategy, drift monitoring, and governance

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple rolling aggregate for 90-day window on-device
function rollingAvg(values, window=90) {
  let sum=0;
  const res=[];
  for(let i=0;i<values.length;i++){
    sum+=values[i];
    if(i>=window) sum-=values[i-window];
    if(i>=window-1) res.push(sum/(window));
  }
  return res;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate accuracy of aggregates vs server baselines?
- What are rollback or revocation strategies if consent changes mid-rollout?

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to quantify edge privacy investments, regulatory costs, and business impact for a real-world data minimization feature across Cloudflare/Snowflake contexts.

## Key Concepts
- Edge data minimization and on-device processing
- Local aggregation and secure delta encoding
- Regulatory risk, data residency, and cost-of-change trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
function deltaEncode(events) {
  // Simplified delta-encoding by event type counts
  const counts = {};
  for (const e of events) {
    counts[e.type] = (counts[e.type] || 0) + 1;
  }
  return counts;
}
```

